A73. Holey things in Switzerland. ~ CHEESES
A74. What the sap did last spring. ~ RAN

D1. This often chooses to run. ~ SAP
D2. A poisonous tree of Java. ~ UPAS
D3. This kind of thing cannot go on forever. ~ MORTAL
D5. A woman will pose in her birthday clothes for this. ~ ART
D6. This means "nothing doing." ~ NO
